 force"}],["$","td",null,{"children":["About 1,700 men in two brigades",["$","small",null,{"style":{"display":"block"},"children":"Greene’s official report gives 1,727 men remaining under his immediate command after his third brigade was detached to the right."}]]}]]}],["$","tr","Northern-field toll",{"children":[["$","th",null,{"scope":"row","children":"Northern-field toll"}],["$","td",null,{"children":["About 8,000 casualties by 9 a.m. in the episode’s estimate",["$","small",null,{"style":{"display":"block"},"children":"The episode treats the losses as roughly evenly divided between United States and Confederate forces after three hours of combat."}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
11:["$","p",null,{"className":"glance-sources","children":[["$","a","https://civilwarpodcast.org/2017/04/30/civil-war-podcast-episode-193/",{"href":"https://civilwarpodcast.org/2017/04/30/civil-war-podcast-episode-193/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Source: ","Official Civil War Podcast episode 193 page"]}],["$","a","https://www.nps.gov/places/the-east-woods.htm",{"href":"https://www.nps.gov/places/the-east-woods.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[" · ","Antietam National Battlefield: The East Woods"]}],["$","a","https://www.nps.gov/people/joseph-k-mansfield.htm",{"href":"https://www.nps.gov/people/joseph-k-mansfield.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[" · ","Antietam National Battlefield: Joseph K. F. Mansfield"]}],["$","a","https://home.nps.gov/anti/learn/historyculture/org-cht-12-corps.htm",{"href":"https://home.nps.gov/anti/learn/historyculture/org-cht-12-corps.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[" · ","Antietam National Battlefield: XII Corps order of battle"]}],["$","a","https://home.nps.gov/anti/planyourvisit/cornfield-trail-guide.htm",{"href":"https://home.nps.gov/anti/planyourvisit/cornfield-trail-guide.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[" · ","Antietam National Battlefield: Cornfield Trail introduction and map"]}],["$","a","https://www.nps.gov/anti/planyourvisit/cornfield-trail-guide-stop-6.htm",{"href":"https://www.nps.gov/anti/planyourvisit/cornfield-trail-guide-stop-6.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[" · ","Antietam National Battlefield: Cornfield Corner of Death"]}],["$","a","https://home.nps.gov/anti/learn/historyculture/6generals.htm",{"href":"https://home.nps.gov/anti/learn/historyculture/6generals.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[" · ","Antietam National Battlefield: generals killed and wounded"]}],["$","a","https://history.army.mil/portals/143/Images/Publications/catalog/35-3-1.pdf",{"href":"https://history.army.m